{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:55 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:55 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:55 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"西藏那曲市發生約7級地震，震源深度僅10公里。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06f56ff9c4905bd624d861b8fc6768de/2026-10/B.jpeg\"/><p>西藏22日晚發生7級地震，傷亡未明。</p><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣發生7.0級地震，震源深度10公里。</p><img alt=\"西藏那曲市發生約7級地震，震源深度僅10公里。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/085c9c48e3e36f52889a6104dcf04415/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_22_54_21.jpeg\" title=\"西藏那曲市發生約7級地震，震源深度僅10公里。\"/><p>西藏那曲市發生約7級地震，震源深度僅10公里。</p><p>中國地震台網正式測定：10月22日22時33分在西藏那曲市巴青縣（北緯32.40度，東經93.79度）發生7.0級地震，震源深度10公里。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.313525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:55:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:13.212869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.295530+00:00","content_hash":"756422d0f633d8cef9b6a9be81f111f37b3efbba3d7fba803c7550040be0aafb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}